<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This Act may be cited as the Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa (Remembrance Allowance) Act 1990."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
