<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/name> "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "\"child\" includes a step-child and a child adopted, before the death of the recipient, under any written law, custom or usage; \"Decoration\" means the Decoration of Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa conferred under the Statutes of Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa (S.P.); \"Minister\" means the Prime Minister; \"recipient\" means any person who has been conferred the Decoration; \"remembrance allowance\" means the remembrance allowance granted under subsection (1) of section 3; \"spouse\" means the widow or widower of a deceased recipient whose marriage is recognized in Malaysia as a valid marriage under any written law, religion, custom or usage."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
