<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "upon the recipient being convicted for an offence by a court of law in the Federation and sentenced to death, or to imprisonment for any term otherwise than imprisonment in lieu of payment of fine; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
