<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "upon cancellation or annullment of conferment of the Decoration in accordance with section VIII of the Statutes of Seri Pahlawan Gagah Perkasa, and no remembrance allowance shall be paid commencing with the month in which the death takes place, or the sentence is imposed, or the conferment of the Decoration is cancelled or annulled, as the case may be. (REMEMBRANCE ALLOWANCE)"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
