<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If the recipient receives a free pardon in respect of the said conviction, or if the cancelled or annulled Decoration is restored to him, the remembrance allowance shall be restored to him commencing from the month in which the free pardon is received or the restoration of the Decoration is made."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/3/eng@> .
